msgstr "Duer för't Wiesen vun de \"Al raadt\"-Mellen"

#. i18n: file timerdlg.ui line 181
#: rc.cpp:87
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can set the time for displaying the Already Guessed tooltip after you try a "
"letter that was already guessed. Default is 3 seconds but younger children "
"might need longer time to be able to understand they are trying a letter that "
"was already guessed."
msgstr ""
"Du kannst de Duer för de Mellen fastleggen, de na't Raden vun en al versöcht "
"Bookstaav opdukt. Standard sünd dree Sekunnen, man lütter Kinner köönt villicht "
"wat länger bruken, ehr se versteiht, dat se den Bookstaav al versöcht hebbt."

